{{Stat|rt}} is a [[Rift Stat]]. It determines the amount of time the player can spend in the [[Rift|Rift Dimension]] before being sent back to the {{Zone|Wizard Tower}} in the [[Hub]].

== Mechanics ==
The player has a base {{stat|Rift Time}} of {{Green|8:00}}. Each {{stat|rt}} the player has is equivalent to each second the player has left in the [[Rift|Rift Dimension]]. While the player is in the {{Zone|Wizard Tower (Rift)}}, {{Zone|Rift Gallery}}, or {{Zone|Mirrorverse}}, their {{Statname|Rift Time}} does not deplete. When in or near the [[Colosseum (Rift)|Colosseum]], it depletes two times slower, and when in the [[Time Chamber]], it depletes two times faster.

Once the player's {{stat|Rift Time}} drops to {{Green|00:10}}, they will be alerted with the following message:

{{TextSection|boxed=true
|text={{Dialogue|
&5{{Dashline}}
&d&lTHE RIFT IS COLLAPSING
&7You only have &a10 seconds&7 left before you are sent back
&7to the Wizard in the SkyBlock Hub!
&5{{Dashline}}
}}
}}

When the player's {{stat|Rift Time}} reaches {{Green|0s}}, they will be removed from the [[Rift]], and will be teleported to the {{Zone|Wizard Tower}} on the [[Hub Island]].

The last {{Green|10s}} of {{Stat|rift time}} is immune to any effects that removes your {{Stat|rift time}}.

