== Trivia ==
* The symbol for {{stat|rt}} used to be the [[w:Ef (Cyrillic)|Cyrillic letter ф (Ef)]], which was derived from, looks very similar to, and is pronounced the same as the [[w:Phi|Greek letter φ (Phi)]]. However, they are not the same, and they have different [[w:Unicode|Unicode]] code points.
* Due to {{Statname|Rift Time}} not decreasing when in the {{Zone|Wizard Tower (Rift)}}, {{Zone|Rift Gallery}}, and {{Zone|Mirrorverse}}, and the lack of naturally hostile mobs in those areas, it is possible to remain in the [[Rift]] for an indefinite amount of time.

